# Exemptions for the real React gate (scripts/verify-react.sh).
#
# Format: TAB-separated — file-glob<TAB>code<TAB>task<TAB>reason
#   code  = TSxxxx (tsc) or bare eslint rule id
#   task  = the implementation task that fixes the ROOT CAUSE
#   reason = inventory snapshot (counts as of 2026-08-02, react 19.2.8 +
#            zustand 5.0.14, fresh `omnic build --target react` output)
#
# Glob: `*` covers everything in gate scope (tsc include + eslint file list:
# src/ + components/ + pages/ + stores/ + root-level generated files).
# src/main.tsx and env.d.ts are hand-owned harness code — keep them clean;
# the exemptions document GENERATED-output errors only.
#
# Gate semantics:
#   - a non-exempt error fails the gate (new regression)
#   - an UNUSED exemption also fails the gate (stale entry — delete it when
#     the root cause lands; do not leave it to rot)
#
# Counts: 284 tsc errors + 109 eslint problems over 157 generated files.
#
# tsc — C1 class (function/typed-state emission) → Task 1.6
*	TS7006	T1.6	123x implicit-any fn params — codegen omits fn param types
*	TS7005	T1.6	2x implicit any[] vars (InlineStoreDemo)
*	TS7034	T1.6	1x implicit any[] partial inference (InlineStoreDemo)
*	TS2304	T1.6	59x undefined names — emitted calls to never-defined fns/vars
*	TS2722	T1.6	21x invoke of possibly-undefined event-handler props
*	TS2686	T1.6	2x React UMD global — generated files lack React import
*	TS2588	T1.6	3x assign to const — let/const emission (ErrorHandlingDemo)
*	TS18048	T1.6	4x possibly-undefined ref access (ElementRefDemo)
*	TS18046	T1.6	2x 'unknown' callback args (StdLibShowcase)
*	TS2769	T1.6	2x no overload matches (EmitKeywordDemo)
*	TS2554	T1.6	6x wrong callback arity (FormPage, FormControlsDemo)
*	TS2322	T1.6	13x not assignable to never[] — untyped useState emission
*	TS2345	T1.6	10x SetStateAction<never[]> — untyped useState emission
*	TS2367	T1.6	2x void-vs-string comparison (DataFetching fetch typing)
# tsc — C2 class (style channel) → Task 1.3
*	TS2353	T1.3	14x CSS custom properties (--var) rejected by React.CSSProperties
# tsc — T3.3 class (store slices / typed state) → Task 3.3
*	TS2339	T3.3	20x property access on 'never' — untyped store/state slices
# eslint — react-hooks + TS rules on generated code → Task 1.6
*	react-hooks/exhaustive-deps	T1.6	93x missing/new-array deps — codegen dependency-array emission
*	@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars	T1.6	13x generated unused identifiers (_b/_i)
*	@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any	T1.6	1x generated any annotation (FnFormatter)
*	no-control-regex	T1.6	2x generated regex with control chars (StdLibShowcase)
